  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組為平原地區加入了<strong>災厄村民堡壘</strong>，裡面充滿了戰利品與珍貴物資。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生成位置：</strong><strong>堡壘</strong>會出現在<strong>平原生態域</strong>中。</li>\n<li><strong>災厄村民：</strong>堡壘由各種災厄村民把守。</li>\n<li>掠奪者負責保護戰利品，你也能發現隱藏的寶物。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/153/310/172/illager-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"164\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/151/310/172/illager-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"164\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/157/310/172/illager-cover.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"165\"></p>\n<p>歡迎在您的整合包中使用此模組</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/149/310/172/illager-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"164\"></p>\n<p>本模組由以下夥伴合作製作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fmrminetex%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrMinetex</a></p>",
